 p a shocking new threat to the city and those he loves - a powerful villai
 n no one can even see.\n\nStarring: Tom Holland\, Zendaya\, Mark Ruffalo\,
  Jon Bernthal\, Jacob Batalon\, Sadie Sink\n\nFilm release at Merlin Cinem
 as Redruth\nBook tickets: /film/spiderman-brand-new-day-3d\n\nFilm details
